 "title": "40 V, 5.8 A N-channel trench MOSFET in SOT-23-3L",
 "source": {
  "revision": "Dec. 2014",
  "pages": 5
 },
 "summary": "A single N-channel MOSFET made on a dense trench process, rated 40 V drain to source and ±20 V gate to source, in the three-lead SOT-23-3L. On-resistance is 50 mΩ max with 10 V of gate drive and 60 mΩ max at 4.5 V, with a threshold of 0.6 V to 1.6 V. Its listed uses are high-frequency point-of-load synchronous buck converters for motherboards, notebooks, UMPCs and graphics cards, networking DC-DC supplies and load switches. Every part is avalanche tested to 9 mJ.",
 "key_figures": [
